#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.3.0"
msgstr "v2.3.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.3.0 adds **ZBar barcode decoding**, a new **Bayer / RAW pixel format** (2"
" BPP, enabling VGA Bayer capture), image streaming, **WINC WiFi AP mode**, "
"separable-convolution acceleration, and MAVLink / Pixy-emulation example "
"scripts. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — v2.2.0 scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v2.3.0 新增了 **ZBar 条形码解码**\\ 、一种新的 **Bayer / RAW 像素格式**\\ （2 BPP，可实现 VGA "
"Bayer 采集）、图像流传输、\\ **WINC WiFi AP 模式**\\ 、可分离卷积加速，以及 MAVLink / Pixy "
"仿真示例脚本。本版本\\ **没有破坏性 API 变更** —— v2.2.0 的脚本无需修改即可运行。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:20
msgid "**ZBar barcodes** — barcode decoding integrated."
msgstr "**ZBar 条形码** —— 集成了条形码解码功能。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Bayer / RAW pixel format** — new 2 BPP format enabling VGA Bayer capture."
msgstr "**Bayer / RAW 像素格式** —— 新增 2 BPP 格式，可实现 VGA Bayer 采集。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:22
msgid "**Image streaming** added."
msgstr "新增了\\ **图像流传输**\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:23
msgid "**WINC AP mode** — the WINC1500 WiFi can act as an access point."
msgstr "**WINC AP 模式** —— WINC1500 WiFi 可充当接入点。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:24
msgid "**Separable convolution** — faster Gaussian / convolution kernels."
msgstr "**可分离卷积** —— 更快的高斯 / 卷积核。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v2.2.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "**没有破坏性 API 变更** —— 重新刷写固件后，你的 v2.2.0 脚本无需修改即可运行。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:29
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:31
msgid "**ZBar** — integrated the ZBar barcode decoder for barcode detection."
msgstr "**ZBar** —— 集成了 ZBar 条形码解码器以进行条形码检测。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Bayer / RAW** — added a new RAW/Bayer pixel format (2 BPP, VGA-capable), "
"Bayer sensor support in the OV7725 driver, Bayer JPEG support, an "
"``IM_GET_RAW_PIXEL`` accessor, and Bayer write support in the image buffer "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"**Bayer / RAW** —— 新增一种 RAW/Bayer 像素格式（2 BPP，支持 VGA）、OV7725 驱动中的 Bayer "
"传感器支持、Bayer JPEG 支持、一个 ``IM_GET_RAW_PIXEL`` 访问器，以及图像缓冲区协议中的 Bayer 写入支持。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:36
msgid "**Image streaming** — added image-streaming support."
msgstr "**图像流传输** —— 新增了图像流传输支持。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"**WINC AP mode** — added WINC1500 access-point mode with an MJPEG AP-mode "
"example."
msgstr "**WINC AP 模式** —— 新增 WINC1500 接入点模式，并附带一个 MJPEG AP 模式示例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Examples** — added MAVLink scripts for quadcopters and Pixy-emulation "
"scripts."
msgstr "**示例** —— 新增用于四旋翼飞行器的 MAVLink 脚本和 Pixy 仿真脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:43
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"Added separable convolution and separable Gaussian kernels (used in ORB and "
"the Gaussian filter) for faster filtering; used faster SPI GPIO."
msgstr "新增了可分离卷积和可分离高斯核（用于 ORB 和高斯滤波器）以加快滤波速度；改用了更快的 SPI GPIO。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:49
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "缺陷修复"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"Fixed the AprilTag z-translation value (re-check code that consumed AprilTag"
" z-translation), the UART receiving code, the ``py_image`` assertion message"
" and framebuffer size checks, and a logical-test error in ZBar."
msgstr ""
"修复了 AprilTag z 平移值（请重新检查使用 AprilTag z 平移值的代码）、UART 接收代码、\\ ``py_image`` "
"断言消息和帧缓冲区大小检查，以及 ZBar 中的一个逻辑测试错误。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:56
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬件与开发板支持"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:58
msgid "**Bayer / RAW** sensor pixel format (OV7725)."
msgstr "**Bayer / RAW** 传感器像素格式（OV7725）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:59
msgid "**WINC1500** — access-point (AP) mode."
msgstr "**WINC1500** —— 接入点（AP）模式。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:62
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破坏性 API 变更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.3.0.rst:64
msgid ""
"v2.3.0 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v2.2.0 run unchanged on v2.3.0 — just reflash the firmware. (Note: the "
"AprilTag z-translation value was corrected; re-validate code that depended "
"on the previous, incorrect value.)"
msgstr ""
"v2.3.0 **没有破坏性的 Python API 变更**\\ 。在 v2.2.0 上运行的脚本在 v2.3.0 上无需修改即可运行 —— "
"只需重新刷写固件。（注意：AprilTag z 平移值已被修正；请重新验证依赖之前那个错误值的代码。）"
